{
  "format": 1,
  "title": "Drive More Than Bones",
  "summary": "Make a button drive a shape key and a modifier input, two things at once, and switch between its two drags with Alt.",
  "order": 3,
  "practice": "../_scenes/shape_cube_region.blend",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Step 1: Round It with a Shape Key",
      "text": [
        "1. Under Up / Down, click Rotate X to open its command.",
        "2. Set Drives to Property.",
        "3. Click the Path field and pick the Sphere shape key.",
        "",
        "This cube is one region, with Button 1 picked for you. A property is any value Blender keeps: here the cube's Sphere shape key, which rounds it into a sphere."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "01_shape_key.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.kind"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.kind",
          "is": "PROPERTY"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.data_path",
          "is": "data.shape_keys.key_blocks[\"Sphere\"].value"
        }
      ],
      "start": {
        "mode": "OBJECT",
        "select": [
          "Cube"
        ],
        "active": "Cube",
        "sidebar": "Kneady",
        "view": {
          "location": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "rotation": [
            0.71238,
            0.44106,
            0.28736,
            0.46412
          ],
          "distance": 10.0,
          "perspective": "PERSP"
        },
        "set": [
          {
            "path": "scene.kneady_on",
            "value": true
          },
          {
            "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].tree_open",
            "value": true
          },
          {
            "path": "window_manager.kneady_row",
            "value": 1
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 2: Twist It with a Modifier Input",
      "text": [
        "1. Under Left / Right, click Rotate Y to open its command.",
        "2. Set Drives to Modifier Input.",
        "3. Click the Input field and pick Twist.",
        "",
        "Twist is an input of the cube's Geometry Nodes modifier: it turns the cube's top against its bottom."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "02_modifier_input.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].across.kind"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].across.kind",
          "is": "INPUT"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].across.input",
          "is": "Twist"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 3: Try It",
      "text": [
        "1. Drag the button up: the cube rounds into a sphere.",
        "2. Drag it left and right: it twists.",
        "",
        "Ctrl+Z puts it back, a drag at a time."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "03_try.mp4",
          "label": "In the viewport",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].data.shape_keys.key_blocks[\"Sphere\"].value",
          "changed": true
        },
        {
          "operator": "kneady.drag",
          "with": {
            "target": "Cube",
            "region": 1,
            "button": 0
          },
          "moved": true
        }
      ],
      "start": {
        "view": {
          "location": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "rotation": [
            0.71238,
            0.44106,
            0.28736,
            0.46412
          ],
          "distance": 10.0,
          "perspective": "PERSP"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 4: Two Things at Once",
      "text": [
        "1. Under Up / Down, click Add Command.",
        "2. Set the new command's Drives to Scale.",
        "3. Click All.",
        "",
        "Every command of a drag moves together: dragging up now rounds the cube and grows it."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "04_two_at_once.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.more[0].kind"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.more[0].kind",
          "is": "SCALE"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].up.more[0].axis",
          "is": "ALL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 5: Switch with Alt",
      "text": [
        "1. Drag the button up: the cube rounds and grows.",
        "2. Still holding the mouse button, press and hold Alt: the drag twists it instead.",
        "3. Let go of Alt: it rounds again.",
        "",
        "Each drag keeps what the other did, so you can shape the cube in one go."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "05_alt.mp4",
          "label": "In the viewport",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].data.shape_keys.key_blocks[\"Sphere\"].value",
          "changed": true
        },
        {
          "operator": "kneady.drag",
          "with": {
            "target": "Cube",
            "region": 1,
            "button": 0
          },
          "moved": true
        }
      ],
      "start": {
        "view": {
          "location": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "rotation": [
            0.71238,
            0.44106,
            0.28736,
            0.46412
          ],
          "distance": 10.0,
          "perspective": "PERSP"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
